<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MIC" style="id">- Kwele Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Mika</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mika</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mika</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mika</para>
  <para style="mt">Mika</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongozi</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu chino cholonga ulotezi wa Mika. Mika kalawa muna dibululu muna iisi ya Yuda ditangigwa Moleshesi (sula ya 1:1 na Yelemia sula ya 26:18). Kalotela lusita lwa utawala wa wafalume Yosamu na Ahazi na Hezekia wa Yuda. Ino yofambula kuwa kasang'hana hagati ya mwaka 750 KK na 700 KK, habehi na lusita luja luwalotele Isaya na Hosea. Haimanyika kuwa ulotezi uno wandikigwa na Mika hebu mwanahina wake. Yodahika chitabu chino chandikigwa hagati ya mwaka 700 KK na mwaka 608 KK kwaviya itambuligwa muna ichitabu cha Yelemia.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ulotezi wa Mika wolonga kusonhela nhaguso ya Mulungu na ulopozi wake. Kowalonga Waisilaili na wanhu wa Yuda kwa kuleka kuwatendela vinogile ngayengaye na kumelela mate vinhu (sula ya 2:2). Kowalonga walotezi wawo kwaviya wohokela lushwa muladi walave ulotezi wa uvwizi (sula ya 3:5). Ivo Mulungu yahayanangile mabululu yawo (sula ya 1:6 na sula ya 3:12) na kuwagala kuutumwa kutali na Isilaili, hamwande iviya yahawagalile wanhu wa Yuda kuutumwa. Mbali Mulungu yahakumbuke chilagano chake na kuwabweleza Waisilaili wadodo muna iisi yawo (sula ya 4:6). Iviya Mulungu keka chilagano cha kumtuma mtawala kulawa Beselehemu, msang'hani yasaguligwe na Mulungu yondayatawale Isilaili na zisi zose (sula ya 5:2-4). Chitabu cha Mika chokomelezeka kwa kukumbusa lagano da Mulungu kwa Bulahimu na Yakobo. Ulondo na ubazi wa Mulungu vohuma ludoko lwake.</para>
  <para style="iot">Mbuli zilimuno</para>
  <para style="io">1. Sula ya 1 na 2 zina hanhu ha mwanduso ha nhaguso na ulopozi.</para>
  <para style="io">2. Sula ya 3 mbaka sula ya 5 zina hanhu hekaidi ha nhaguso na ulopozi.</para>
  <para style="io">3. Sula ya 6 na 7 zina hanhu ha uhelelo ha nhaguso na ulopozi.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MIC 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MIC 1:1" />Mndewa Mulungu kalonga na mulotezi Mika mkaya wa Moleshesi muna zisiku za utawala wa Yosamu na utawala wa Ahazi na utawala wa Hezekia viwakalile wafalume wa Yuda. Mika kawona mbuli zino zose kusonhela Samalia na Yelusalemu.<verse eid="MIC 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nhaguso ya Samalia</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MIC 1:2" />Tegelezeni, mweye wanhu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:2">tegelezeni, mweye zisi zose na vinhu vose vili umo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:2">Mndewa Mulungu kokwiza kumulongani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:2">kulawa kuna ikaye yake yelile.<verse eid="MIC 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MIC 1:3" />Mndewa Mulungu kokwiza kulawa hanhu hake hoyokala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:3">kokwiza na kobojoga uchanyha ya milima.<verse eid="MIC 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MIC 1:4" />Milima izalumbuzuka fana uhula habehi na moto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:4">Mabawe yezatulika fana viya uhula habehi na moto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:4">fana mazi viyokilima muna ingema.<verse eid="MIC 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MIC 1:5" />Mbuli zino zose zizalawilila kwa ichimu cha mbuli zihile ziwatendile welesi wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:5">na kwa ichimu cha uhasanyi wa wanhu wa Isilaili.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:5">Vino uhasanyi wa welesi wa Yakobo wakulihi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:5">Wauko Samalia.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:5">Vino hanhu howotambikila wanhu wa Yuda hakulihi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:5">Hauko Yelusalemu.<verse eid="MIC 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MIC 1:6" />Ivo Mndewa Mulungu kolonga, “Nizaditenda bululu da Samalia kuwa matongo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:6">Migunda ya mizabibu izakuwa uko.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:6">Mabwe youzengile nizayasa kudikolongo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:6">na nizavihimbula vandusilo vake.<verse eid="MIC 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MIC 1:7" />Nizazibena nyang'hiti zose za milungu ya uvwizi ya Samalia.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:7">Vinhu vose vilavigwe vizatimbuligwa na moto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:7">nizazinanga nyang'hiti zake zose za milungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:7">Kwaviya kapata vinhu ivo fana viyolihigwa malaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:7">vovisang'haniligwa kuliha yombe da malaya imwenga.”<verse eid="MIC 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mulotezi koiyalala kwa ichimu cha Yelusalemu na Yuda</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MIC 1:8" />Kwa ichimu chino nizalila na kuomboleza na nizagenda ukengele na nizagenda bila vilatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:8">nizabwaka fana mbwizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:8">nizaiyalala na kulila fana bundi.<verse eid="MIC 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MIC 1:9" />Kwaviya utamu wa wanhu wa Samalia haudaha kuhona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:9">iviya uwapata wanhu wa isi ya Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:9">ulufikila lwivi lwa Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:9">hanhu howokala wanhu wangu.<verse eid="MIC 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MIC 1:10" />Sekemugong'onde mbuli ino uko Gasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:10">na sekemulile masozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:10">mubimbilike muna ditimbwisi uko Besi Leafila.<verse eid="MIC 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MIC 1:11" />Mweye mukala Shafili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:11">muhite ukengele na muwe na chinyala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:11">Wakaya wa Saanani sekemulawe kunze ya bululu jawo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:11">Wanhu wa Besi Ezeli wolila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:11">hawezamtazani.<verse eid="MIC 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MIC 1:12" />Wakaya wa Malosi wogozela ng'hani kutazigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:12">mbali ndilo yokwiza kulawa kwa Mndewa Mulungu na ifika muna dibululu da Yelusalemu.<verse eid="MIC 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MIC 1:13" />Mweye wakaya wa Lakishi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:13">muwafungile falasi matololi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:13">Muwakwega Waisilaili kutenda uhasanyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:13">uhasanyi wa Waisilaili uwoneka kumwenu.<verse eid="MIC 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MIC 1:14" />Ivo molondeka kuwalaga wakaya wa Moleshesi Gasi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:14">Lelo Bululu da Akizibu hadizawataza wafalume wa Isilaili kwa chinhu chochose.<verse eid="MIC 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MIC 1:15" />Mweye wakaya wa Malesha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:15">Mulungu kezamgalilani mwihi yondayamsoleni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:15">Watawala wakulu wa Isilaili wezakimbilila kuifisa mudituka da Adulamu.<verse eid="MIC 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MIC 1:16" />Mweye wanhu wa Yuda, weguleni matwi yenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:16">muwalilile wanenu womuwalonda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:16">Weguleni mabwenzi muladi muwoneke fana vilele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:16">kwaviya wanenu wahita kutali na mweye kuuhami.<verse eid="MIC 1:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MIC 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MIC 2" />
  <para style="s">Mulungu kowatagusa wowagaza ngayengaye</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MIC 2:1" />Wezagaya wanhu wogesa mbuli zihile na woilunga kusang'hana wihi muna yamakomwa yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:1">imitondo wotenda mbuli izo, kwaviya wodaha kutenda ivo.<verse eid="MIC 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MIC 2:2" />Womelela mate migunda na kuisola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:2">wahalonda kaye wohoka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:2">Wowagaza wanhu na kaye zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:2">wowabamanya wanhu uhazi wawo.<verse eid="MIC 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MIC 2:3" />Ivo Mndewa Mulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:3">“Noilunga kumgalilani magayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:3">hamudaha kugwaza hata chidogo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:3">lwizakuwa lusita lwihile kumwenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:3">na hamwizagenda kwa magoda.<verse eid="MIC 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MIC 2:4" />Siku iyo wanhu wezamtungilani nyila za kumzehani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:4">wezalila kuno wolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:4">‘Cheye chinangigwa ng'hani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:4">Mndewa Mulungu kaisola isi yetu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:4">Kaisegeza muna yamakono yetu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:4">Migunda yetu kawagolela wachitekile.’ ”<verse eid="MIC 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MIC 2:5" />Ivo hamwizagoliligwa hanhu hohose ha isi mwa wanhu wa Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="MIC 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MIC 2:6" />Walotezi wawo wolonga, “Sekemulotele.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:6">Sekemulotele mbuli izo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:6">Cheye hachizapata magayo.”<verse eid="MIC 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MIC 2:7" />Mweye welesi wa Yakobo, vino mbuli zino ziuzigwe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:7">Vino Mndewa Mulungu kaleka kufunya umoyo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:7">Vino nikutendela mbuli zilingile ivo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:7">Mbuli zangu zowafaya wanhu wotenda vinhu vinogile.<verse eid="MIC 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MIC 2:8" />Mbali Mndewa Mulungu komulongelani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:8">“Wanhu wangu wawa fana wehi wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:8">Mowahoka mbwiya zenu mawalo yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:8">mowahoka wanhu wogenda bila kudumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:8">na hawagesa ng'hondo.<verse eid="MIC 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MIC 2:9" />Mowawinga wake za wanhu wangu muna zikaye zawo zinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:9">mowasegezela wana wawo uhazi uweng'higwe na Mulungu siku zose.<verse eid="MIC 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MIC 2:10" />Inukeni musegele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:10">hano habule hanhu ha kuhumula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:10">kwaviya hambula mwiko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:10">hanangigwa ng'hani.<verse eid="MIC 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MIC 2:11" />One munhu kolawilila na kogong'onda mbuli za uvwizi muhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:11">na kulonga, ‘Nowalotela mweye divai nyingi na upele mwingi.’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:11">Munhu iyo kezakuwa mulotezi wa wanhu wano.<verse eid="MIC 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MIC 2:12" />Mbali kweli nizamkunzagizani mweye welesi wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:12">nizamkunzagizani mweye Waisilaili musigale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:12">niwagale hamwe fana ng'hondolo muna ichikwama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:12">Fana viya bumbila kulu da ng'hondolo muna umgunda wa mayani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:12">mweye mwizakuwa bumbila da wanhu wengi.<verse eid="MIC 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MIC 2:13" />Yondayatule nzila kezawalongolela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:13">nawo wezalubena lwivi lukulu lwa bululu na kulawa kunze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:13">wezafosa na kulawa kunze.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:13">Mfalume wawo kezawalongolela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:13">Mndewa Mulungu mwenyewo kezawalongolela.”<verse eid="MIC 2:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MIC 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MIC 3" />
  <para style="s">Mika kowazuma walangulizi wa Isilaili</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MIC 3:1" />Lelo tegelezeni, mweye walangulizi wa welesi wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:1">mweye watawala wa isi ya Isilaili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:1">molondeka kuvimanya kutenda voilondeka.<verse eid="MIC 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MIC 3:2" />Mbali mweye mokwihila mbuli zinogile molonda mbuli zihile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:2">Motenda fana wanhu wochinja, mowachuna mbende wanhu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:2">na mosegeza nyama muna yamavuha yawo.<verse eid="MIC 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MIC 3:3" />Mweye moja nyama ya wanhu wangu na mowachuna mbende zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:3">moyabena mavuha yawo na mowakanhakanha fana ndiya ya kwambika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:3">fana nyama ya kwika muna inongo.<verse eid="MIC 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MIC 3:4" />Lusita lokwiza mwizampula Mndewa Mulungu yamtazeni, mbali hezamwidikani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:4">Lusita ulwo kezamfisani chihanga chake kwa ichimu cha mbuli zihile zimutendile.<verse eid="MIC 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MIC 3:5" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga, “Walotezi wowagiza wanhu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:5">waheng'higwa ndiya, wogong'onda tindiwalo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:5">mbali one haweng'higwe ndiya wowadumbiza wanhu kwa kulotela ng'hondo.<verse eid="MIC 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MIC 3:6" />Kumwenu mweye walotezi kwizakuwa ichilo chilibule malaguso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:6">kwizakuwa ziza kumwenu kwilibule magubulo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:6">Zuwa dizakuswa kumwenu, imisi kwizakuwa fana ichilo.<verse eid="MIC 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MIC 3:7" />Walotezi wezapata chinyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:7">watowabao wezakugwa chinyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:7">wose wezagubika vihanga vawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:7">kwaviya Mulungu hezawedika mbuli yoyose.”<verse eid="MIC 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MIC 3:8" />Mbali niye nimemezigwa nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:8">ning'higwa nguvu na Muhe wa Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:8">ning'higwa udahi wa kuhumiza voilondeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:8">niwagong'ondele welesi wa Yakobo uhasanyi wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:8">niwalongele Waisilaili ubananzi wawo.<verse eid="MIC 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MIC 3:9" />Mweye walangulizi wa welesi wa Yakobo, tegelezeni mbuli ino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:9">tegelezeni mweye walangulizi wa wanhu wa Isilaili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:9">mokwihila kuhumiza voilondeka na mogalula mbuli inogile kuwa ihile.<verse eid="MIC 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MIC 3:10" />Mozenga bululu da Sayuni kwa kukoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:10">mozenga Yelusalemu kwa wihi.<verse eid="MIC 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MIC 3:11" />Walangulizi wohumiza kwa lushwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:11">na wakulu wa nhambiko wofundiza kwa kulihigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:11">na walotezi wolotela kwa hela.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:11">Waja wogesa womuhuwila Mulungu kuno wolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:11">“Mndewa Mulungu kahamwe na cheye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:11">Habule mbuli ihile yondaichipate.”<verse eid="MIC 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MIC 3:12" />Lelo kwa ichimu chenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:12">bululu da Sayuni dizalimigwa fana mgunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:12">na bululu da Yelusalemu dizakuwa matongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:12">na mulima wa kaye ya Mulungu wizakuwa mbago.<verse eid="MIC 3:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MIC 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MIC 4" />
  <para style="s">Mulima wa Mndewa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MIC 4:1" />Lusita lokwiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:1">mulima wa kaye ya Mndewa Mulungu wizakuwa mkulu kufosa milima yose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:1">Wizakwinuligwa uchanyha ya vilima vose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:1">Wanhu wengi wezaimemeza umo.<verse eid="MIC 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MIC 4:2" />Wanhu wengi wezakwiza na kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:2">“Chiteni kuna umulima wa Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:2">kuna ikaye ya Mulungu wa Yakobo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:2">Kezachifunza ndagilizi zake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:2">muladi chizizindilile.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:2">Kwaviya mafundizo yezalawa Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:2">mbuli ya Mndewa Mulungu izalawa Yelusalemu.<verse eid="MIC 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MIC 4:3" />Mndewa Mulungu kezahumiza hagati ya wanhu wengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:3">kezawazuma wanhu wa zisi zili kutali zili na nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:3">Wawo wezanola mazele yawo yagaluke kuwa magembe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:3">na migoha yawo igaluke kuwa sengo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:3">Wanhu hawezakwinula mazele kuwatenda vihile wanhu wa isi imwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:3">hebu kusasala ng'hondo kaidi.<verse eid="MIC 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MIC 4:4" />Chila munhu kezakala kwa tindiwalo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:4">hasi ya mibiki ya nhini na mizabibu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:4">bila kudumbizigwa na munhu yoyose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:4">Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kalonga mbuli izo.<verse eid="MIC 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MIC 4:5" />Wanhu wamwenga wosondelela milungu yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:5">mbali cheye chomsondelela Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wetu siku zose.<verse eid="MIC 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waisilaili wezabwela kulawa kuuhami</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MIC 4:6" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga, “Siku iyo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:6">nizawakunzagiza mbetembete,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:6">na nizawakunzagiza wanhu wagaligwe kuuhami,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:6">wanhu niwagazile.”<verse eid="MIC 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MIC 4:7" />Nizawatenda mbetembete wasigale wagima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:7">nizawatenda wanhu wagaligwe kuuhami wawe isi ili na nguvu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:7">Mndewa Mulungu kezawatawala kuna umulima Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:7">kwandusila lusita luja na siku zose.<verse eid="MIC 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MIC 4:8" />Weye Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:8">uli mulima wa Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:8">fana Mulungu kowakaliza wanhu wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:8">fana mdimi viyodima ng'hondolo wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:8">kwizakuwa bululu dinogile ng'hani fana umwaka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:8">Yelusalemu kwizakuwa bululu kulu da mfalume kaidi.<verse eid="MIC 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MIC 4:9" />Lelo habali molila kwa dizi kulu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:9">Vino mwabule mfalume?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:9">Vino wabala wenu wose wadanganika?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:9">Mogutilila fana muke yolumwa usungu.<verse eid="MIC 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MIC 4:10" />Mweye wanhu wa Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:10">lileni na mubimbilike fana muke yolumwa usungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:10">kwaviya mwizasegela muna dibululu dino na mwizahita kukala kuchuwala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:10">Mwizahita kukala Babeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:10">mbali uko, niye Mndewa Mulungu, nizamulopolani muna yamakono ya wehi wenu.<verse eid="MIC 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MIC 4:11" />Wanhu wa zisi nyingi woiting'hana muladi wamtoweni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:11">Woigoda kuno wolonga, “Lekeni bululu da Yelusalemu jambule mwiko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:11">muladi chiyawone matongo ya Sayuni.”<verse eid="MIC 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MIC 4:12" />Mbali hawayamanyile magesa ya Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:12">na hawadimanyile lungilo jake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:12">yeye kezawakunzagiza fana makinza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:12">hana ihanhu ha kubigila.<verse eid="MIC 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MIC 4:13" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:13">“Mweye wanhu wa Sayuni, inukeni muwatowe wehi wenu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:13">Nizamwing'hani nguvu fana za ng'ombe lume.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:13">Nizamwing'hani mahembe ya chuma na mapaga ya shaba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:13">muladi muwahonde wanhu wa zisi nyingi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:13">Vinhu vondamuvihoke mwizaning'ha niye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:13">Mwizaning'ha vinhu vawo niye Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wa zisi zose.”<verse eid="MIC 4:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MIC 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MIC 5" />
  <para style="s">Mtawala kezalawa Beselehemu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MIC 5:1" />Mweye wanhu wa Yelusalemu, iduganyeni kuisasala kwa ng'hondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:1">kwaviya bululu jetu dizingigwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:1">Wehi wetu wachizinga na wachiminya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:1">Wezamtowa mtawala wa Isilaili na fimbo muna dikanza jake.<verse eid="MIC 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MIC 5:2" />Mbali weye bululu da Beselehemu dili Efulata,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:2">ingawa kwa mdodo muna zing'holo za Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:2">kumwako kezalawilila mtawala yondayatawale isi ya Isilaili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:2">yeye kandusa umwaka ng'hani.<verse eid="MIC 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MIC 5:3" />Mulungu kezawaleka wanhu wa Isilaili wahumigwe na wehi wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:3">mbaka muke yeli na usungu vondayaibasule.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:3">Maabaho wanhu wa mtawala iyo wasigale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:3">wezabwela kuilumba na wanhu wa Isilaili.<verse eid="MIC 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MIC 5:4" />Kezakwima na kudidima bumbila jake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:4">kwa udahi wa Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:4">na kwa nguvu za zina jake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:4">Nawo wezakala goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:4">kwaviya kezahishimigwa muna izisi zose.<verse eid="MIC 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MIC 5:5" />Iviya kezagala tindiwalo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:5">Lusita Waashuli vondawaitowe iisi yetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:5">na kufosa muna zimhongono zetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:5">chizatuma wakulu wa watowang'hondo wetu wengi wakawatowe.<verse eid="MIC 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MIC 5:6" />Wezaihuma isi ya Ashulu kwa zele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:6">wezaihuma isi ya Nimulodi kwa mgoha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:6">kezachilopola mwa Waashulu vondawaitowe iisi yetu.<verse eid="MIC 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MIC 5:7" />Welesi wa Yakobo wondawasigale wagima muna izisi nyingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:7">wezakuwa fana viya nhungwe kulawa kwa Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:7">fana mawaga ya mvula muna yamayani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:7">yayo hayagaligwa na munhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:7">na hayamuhuwila munhu.<verse eid="MIC 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MIC 5:8" />Welesi wa Yakobo wasigale wagima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:8">wezapwililika muna izisi zimwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:8">wezakuwa na nguvu ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:8">fana viya simba muna iwanyama wa kumbago,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:8">fana viya mwanasimba muna yamabumbila ya ng'hondolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:8">yolumiza ng'hani na kuvavatula chila viyofosa hagati yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:8">iviya habule yodaha kuwakombola.<verse eid="MIC 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MIC 5:9" />Waisilaili wezawahuma wehi wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:9">na kuwananga ng'hani.<verse eid="MIC 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waisilaili wezatagusigwa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MIC 5:10" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:10">“Lusita ulwo nizawananga falasi wenu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:10">na nizayabananga matololi yenu ya kubululigwa na falasi.<verse eid="MIC 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MIC 5:11" />Nizayananga mabululu yeli muna iisi yenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:11">nizabomola mhongono zenu.<verse eid="MIC 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MIC 5:12" />Nizaubananga uhawi wenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:12">na hamwizatowa bao kaidi.<verse eid="MIC 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MIC 5:13" />Nizazinanga nyang'hiti zenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:13">na mabwe yenu ya nhambiko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:13">ivo mwizaleka kutambikila vinhu vimuvitendile wenyewo.<verse eid="MIC 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MIC 5:14" />Nizazinanga mhanda zenu za mulungu Ashela</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:14">na nizayabomola mabululu yenu.<verse eid="MIC 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MIC 5:15" />Kwa ludoko lwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:15">nizalihiliza chisasi kwa wanhu wa zisi zilema kunitegeleza.”<verse eid="MIC 5:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MIC 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MIC 6" />
  <para style="s">Mndewa Mulungu kowalonga wanhu wake</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MIC 6:1" />Tegelezeni Mndewa Mulungu viyolonga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:1">Inuka ukaiyalale kuna imilima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:1">na vilima vihulike mbuli ziulonga.<verse eid="MIC 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MIC 6:2" />Mweye milima, tegelezeni Mndewa Mulungu viyowalongeleza wanhu wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:2">tegelezeni, mweye vandusilo vigangamale va isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:2">Mndewa Mulungu kana mbuli ya kuwalonga wanhu wake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:2">Yeye kezawalonga Waisilaili.<verse eid="MIC 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MIC 6:3" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:3">“Mweye wanhu wangu, niye nimtendani choni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:3">Nimulegezani na choni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:3">Nilongeleni.<verse eid="MIC 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MIC 6:4" />Nimulavani muna iisi ya Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:4">nimkombolani kulawa kuutumwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:4">nimwing'hani Musa na Haluni na Miliamu wamulangulizeni.<verse eid="MIC 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MIC 6:5" />Mweye wanhu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:5">kumbukeni viya Balaki mfalume wa Moabu viyailungile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:5">iviya Balaamu mwana wa Beoli viyamwidike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:5">mukumbuke mbuli zilawilile muna inzila kulawa Shitimu kuhita Giligali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:5">muladi muzimanye sang'hano zangu zinogile.”<verse eid="MIC 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ziyolonda Mulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MIC 6:6" />Vino nimgalile choni Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:6">muladi nimtambikile Mndewa Mulungu yeli uchanyha ng'hani?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:6">Vino nimgalile nhambiko za kutimbula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:6">hebu nimgalile dang'ang'a da mwaka umwe?<verse eid="MIC 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MIC 6:7" />Vino Mndewa Mulungu kezanogelwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:7">one nihalava maelufu ya mabebelu ya ng'hondolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:7">hebu nyanda elufu longo za mavuta?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:7">Vino nimulavile mwanangu wa udele kwa ichimu cha uhasanyi wangu?<verse eid="MIC 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MIC 6:8" />Mweye wanhu, Mulungu kamulagusani mbuli zimulondeka kutenda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:8">Mndewa Mulungu kolonga mutende vinhu vinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:8">muhumize voilondeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:8">mulonde kuwa na ubazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:8">na mukale kwa kuinyendanyenda kwa Mulungu wenu.<verse eid="MIC 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MIC 6:9" />Mndewa Mulungu kowatanga wakaya wa bululu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:9">vinoga ng'hani kumtambikila yeye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:9">Muihishimu fimbo na ija yaisagule.<verse eid="MIC 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MIC 6:10" />Sizafunyila umoyo vinhu vihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:10">vovimemezigwa muna zikaye za wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:10">vinhu vimupatile kwa ningo za uvwizi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:10">vinhu viya vitibusa.<verse eid="MIC 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MIC 6:11" />Vino nodaha kulonga kuwa wabule ubananzi wanhu wosang'hanila ningo za uvwizi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:11">na mabwe ya kulingila yeli hayafaya?<verse eid="MIC 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MIC 6:12" />Matajili wenu wadugi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:12">wanhu wenu wavwizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:12">na chila mbuli iwolonga ya uvwizi.<verse eid="MIC 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MIC 6:13" />Ivo niye nyandusa kumgwisani hasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:13">na kumnangani kwa ichimu cha uhasanyi wenu.<verse eid="MIC 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MIC 6:14" />Mwizakuja mbali hamwizakwiguta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:14">nzala izaiyoha muna izinda zenu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:14">Mwizakwika ngama mbali haikika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:14">muheka chinhu nizachilava kwa ng'hondo.<verse eid="MIC 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MIC 6:15" />Mwizahanda mbeyu, mbali hamwizagobola.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:15">Mwizakama zaituni, mbali hamwizasang'hanila mavuta yayo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:15">Mwizakama zabibu, mbali hamwizakung'wa divai.<verse eid="MIC 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MIC 6:16" />Mweye mohiga mbuli zihile za mfalume Omili</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:16">na mbuli zihile za welesi wa Ahabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:16">na motenda viwolonda wawo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:16">Ivo nizamnangani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:16">na wanhu wenu wezakwehuligwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:16">Wanhu wa zisi zose wezamzehani.<verse eid="MIC 6:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MIC 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MIC 7" />
  <para style="s">Mulotezi kowona usungu kwa ichimu cha uhasanyi wa Waisilaili</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MIC 7:1" />Nizagaya! Kwaviya nilinga fana munhu yokwaha matunda lusita lwa kugobola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:1">mbali habule nhini za mwanduso zinilonda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:1">Lusita lwa kwaha zabibu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:1">habule hata chipambo chimwe cha kuja.<verse eid="MIC 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MIC 7:2" />Habule munhu mwaminika yasigale muna iisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:2">habule munhu yoyose yotenda goya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:2">Chila munhu kolonda kukoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:2">chila munhu komsepa miyage muladi yamgwile.<verse eid="MIC 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MIC 7:3" />Wose magalu wa kutenda mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:3">walangulizi na wasemi wolonda lushwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:3">Wakulu wolonga mbuli zihile ziwogesa muna imizoyo yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:3">na woilunga kupata chinhu chiwolonda kufosela wasemi.<verse eid="MIC 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MIC 7:4" />Munhu yotenda mbuli zinogile viweli kalinga fana mbigili.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:4">Munhu goya kumwawo kodumbiza kufosa mbago ili na miwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:4">Siku igozigwe ya nhaguso yawo ifika.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:4">Sambi wosafagila ng'hani.<verse eid="MIC 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MIC 7:5" />Sekeumuhuwile miyago,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:5">na sekeumulolele mbwiyako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:5">sekeumulongele muke wako mbuli zili muumoyo wako.<verse eid="MIC 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MIC 7:6" />Kwaviya wana wa chilume wowehula tati zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:6">na wandele woibishila na mami zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:6">iviya wakoi wa chike wowalema wakoi zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:6">wehi wa munhu wolawa muna ikaye yake mwenyewo.<verse eid="MIC 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MIC 7:7" />Mbali niye nomulolela Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:7">nomgozela Mulungu yeli mulopozi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:7">Mulungu wangu kezanihulika.<verse eid="MIC 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mndewa Mulungu kezawalopola wanhu wake</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MIC 7:8" />Sekeudeng'helele mahulo yangu weye mwihi wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:8">Nihagwa, nizakwinuka kaidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:8">nihawa muna diziza, Mndewa Mulungu niijo bung'hulo jangu.<verse eid="MIC 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MIC 7:9" />Kwaviya nimuhasanya Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:9">nizafunyila umoyo ludoko lwake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:9">mbaka vondayanigombele muna imbuli yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:9">na kuning'ha haki yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:9">Kezanigala kunze kuna dibung'hulo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:9">nizauwona ulopozi wake.<verse eid="MIC 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MIC 7:10" />Maabaho mwihi wangu kezawona mbuli iyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:10">na kezawona chinyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:10">kwaviya kanilongela, “Kakulihi Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wako?”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:10">Nizamuwona viyogwa hasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:10">kezabojogigwa fana nhope muna inzila.<verse eid="MIC 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MIC 7:11" />Siku yokwiza, ng'huta za mabululu yenu zizazengigwa kaidi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:11">Siku iyo mhaka za isi yenu zizagalamusigwa.<verse eid="MIC 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MIC 7:12" />Siku iyo ndugu zenu wezambwelelani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:12">kulawa isi ya Ashulu na mabululu ya isi ya Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:12">hata kulawa isi ya Misili mbaka lwanda lwa Efulate,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:12">kulawa bahali imwe kuhita bahali imwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:12">kulawa mulima umwe kuhita mulima umwenga.<verse eid="MIC 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MIC 7:13" />Isi yose izakuwa matongo kwa ichimu cha wakaya wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:13">kwa ichimu cha mbuli zihile ziwatendile.<verse eid="MIC 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kumpula Mulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MIC 7:14" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, uwadime wanhu wako kwa balati jako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:14">udidime bumbila jako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:14">dodikala diidumwe kuna imbago,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:14">kuna iisi ili na ulongo unogile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:14">Uwadime fana viutendile umwaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:14">kuna umgunda wa kudimila uli Bashani na Gileadi.<verse eid="MIC 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MIC 7:15" />Fana siku ija viuchilavile muna iisi ya Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:15">uchilaguse kaidi mauzauza yako.<verse eid="MIC 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MIC 7:16" />Wanhu wa zisi zimwenga vondawahulike mbuli izo wezawona chinyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:16">ingawa wana nguvu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:16">Wezakwika makono yawo muna imilomo yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:16">na magutwi yawo yezatulika.<verse eid="MIC 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MIC 7:17" />Wezakuja msanga fana zoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:17">fana vilumbe vitambala hasi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:17">Wezalawa muna yamatuka yawo kuno wogudemeka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:17">Wezamuhindukila Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wetu kwa kugudemeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:17">na wezamdumba.<verse eid="MIC 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MIC 7:18" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, habule yalingile fana weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:18">kolekelela uhasanyi wa wanhu wako wasigale wagima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:18">na hulola ubananzi wawo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:18">Ludoko lwako halugendelela siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:18">mbali kodeng'helela ng'hani kuwalonda wanhu kwa kufunya umoyo.<verse eid="MIC 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MIC 7:19" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, kwizachiwonela ubazi kaidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:19">kwizaubojoga uhasanyi wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:19">kwizasegeza uhasanyi wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:19">kwizawasa muna ivilindi va bahali.<verse eid="MIC 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MIC 7:20" />Kwizachilagusa waminika wako na viuchilonda kwa kufunya umoyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:20">fana viuwalaganile wasaho zetu Bulahimu na Yakobo.<verse eid="MIC 7:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MIC 7" />
</usx>